graph TD
    A[Heat Stress] --> B[HSF1 Activation]
    B --> C[HSF1 Trimerization]
    C --> D[HSF1 Phosphorylation]
    D --> E[HSF1 Nuclear Localization]
    E --> F[HSE Binding]
    F --> G[Heat Shock Gene Transcription]
    G --> H[Hsp70 Synthesis]
    H --> I[Protein Folding Assistance]
    I --> J[Heat Shock Response Complete]
    
    %% Alternative pathway
    A --> K[Protein Denaturation]
    K --> L[Chaperone Recruitment]
    L --> M[Protein Refolding]
    M --> J
    
    %% Regulation
    J --> N[Stress Status]
    N --> O{Temperature Normal?}
    O -->|Yes| P[Response Termination]
    O -->|No| Q[Response Continuation]
    
    %% Key proteins
    R[HSF1] --> B
    S[HSE] --> F
    T[Hsp70] --> H
    U[Chaperones] --> I
    V[Heat Shock Proteins] --> J
    W[Protein Folding Factors] --> M
    
